ev/pandas/pull/64853.patch', 'merged_at': None}","## Summary
- Fixes incorrect result when subtracting `BusinessHour` (or `CustomBusinessHour`) from a `Timestamp` where the result would land exactly on the business-hour opening time (e.g. `Timestamp(""2000-01-10 10:00"") - BusinessHour(1)` returned `Timestamp(""2000-01-07 17:00"")` instead of `Timestamp(""2000-01-10 09:00"")`)
- Root cause: the boundary condition in the subtraction loop used strict `>` instead of `>=`, causing it to skip to the previous business day's closing time instead of staying at the valid opening time
- Simplified the condition by removing an unnecessary nanosecond special case (handled by `apply_wraps`)

closes #33682

